  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "CHANGED\n\t\t\t* The SPECIFICATION.md header states the subject's version alone. The source id is gone:\n\t\t\tthe document renders what the tests claim, so the body is what has to stay in step with\n\t\t\tthem.\n\t\t\tNEW\n\t\t\t* A [Theory] with [InlineData] renders as one requirement over a table of its rows.\n\t\t\tFIXED\n\t\t\t* A test skipped while it ran (Assert.Skip) no longer counts as a missing requirement,\n\t\t\twhich had left the document silently unwritten on an otherwise green run\n\t\t\t* Split words and numbers correctly\n\t\t\t* keep empty string literal after ?? in specification (str ?? \"\")\n\t\t\t* describe expression with operator properly\n\t\t\t* Format values culture-invariantly, dates as yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss\n\t\t\t* Render the specification identically in every culture",
